["description"] = "I've a feeling I was able to escape my captors because, frankly, there is nowhere to go. Stranded on these platforms, they are bound to find me sooner or later. Unless... It is said that the heart of an elemental noble can grant whoever holds it the characteristics of that element. Which, in the case of air, would be most useful during a downward trip. Bring me Grand Vizier Ertan's heart so I can use its magic to land safely on the shoreline of Uldum.",
