["objectivesText"] = "Obtain 4 Sulfur-Laced Wrappings from Fiery Behemoths in Sethria's Roost. Progress: There are some who say that the sulfur in those wrappings has curative properties. Personally, I am unconvinced, but I am willing to endure the smell on the off-chance that it does.",
