["description"] = "Like many dreadlords, Detheroc cannot help but gloat. He was careless and I overheard many of his plans while I was held captive. With your leave, I would like to underscore the gravity of the situation in Stormwind. The fate of Azeroth hangs in the balance. But for all of that, I have a simple plan: get 'em.",
