["description"] = "So these trials are what will get us the Aegis, and the next one is on the top of that mountain? That may prove problematic. The only way I see up the mountain is through that vrykul city, and the gates are shut tight. We should be able to grapple over, though. If you don't have a launcher, I managed to wrangle a spare from one of these vrykul. I'll scout ahead and see if I can find a good spot to get in.",
