["series"] = { 39339, 39340 },
["description"] = "The key to a crucible like this is that it must be bathed in the foulest of fel energy. I hate to say it, but the most efficient method of accomplishing such a feat is to subject it to the bile of a demon. Yes, I said the bile of a demon. Ready to get to work? In the Vault of the Wardens, such a demon exists. An imp mother by the name of Grimoira . The door to her room is sealed by an invisible lock. I'd suggest bringing some Skaggldrynk with you. Use it when you get to her door.",
["objectivesText"] = "Craft a Skaggldrynk , then go to the Vault of the Wardens and bathe the crucible in the bile of Grimoira .",
