["description"] = "While it's no secret my time is more valuable than... well, anyone's, I fear I must step in and help to replace my decoction conduit. You will also play a crucial part in this, <name>, as my liaison with the blacksmiths. The thought of getting soot on my robes curls my toes. Here's a list of what we'll need done. Meanwhile I'll be out gathering the rest of what's needed.",
