["description"] = "Our power alone may not be enough to fight the behemoth, Geir. Fortunately, Faljar was kind enough to send our allies into Helheim with us. Earlier, I had discovered several of them being tortured by the elemental forces of Helheim . You may think the dead can't drown, but with Helya's power, this is not the case. I could not release them then, but now that you possess the waylight, you may be able to. Seek them out and free them from an eternity of suffering!",
