["description"] = "[PH] As foretold, you have arrived... Helya is foolish to think I'll let her ferry me into Helheim. Odyn has already smiled upon me, my soul belongs in Valhallas. Make no mistake, I am not a prisoner. Before my death Odyn appeared to me in the form of a raven. He praised my battles in life and gave me a quest no vrykul could refuse. The Helerjar arrived... and I let them slay me. Prisoner-- nay, I am a liberator, sent by Odyn to free the souls of Valarjar.",
["objectivesText"] = "Defeat Helya and free the Valarjar.",
