["description"] = "Very well, I won't deny it. The Steamy Romance Novel is mine. I only read it for the penmanship, I assure you! He writes such curvy \"B\"s... and such ample \"D\"s! In fact... you might benefit from a penmanship lesson. The author of these books is one B. Spearshaker. I believe he can be found in the library in Ironforge. Stop reading, student. You are dismissed. And give me my book back!",
