["description"] = "I have a theory on how we can better harvest this felwort, <name>. You see, sometimes in order to understand how something comes into being, you have to work backwards. I've recently heard of the corruption of one of our greatest gods, Cenarius. I have no doubt the same corruption that lives in these herbs also resides within him now. If you were able to cleanse that corruption, find a way to understand how it works and remove it, I think we can apply that to how we harvest these herbs.",
["objectivesText"] = "Travel to the Emerald Nightmare and cleanse Cenarius of his affliction. Bring back anything you discover to Kuhuine in Dalaran. Progress: I hope you bring some friends with you on this journey, for this may be your greatest lesson.",
