["series"] = { 40325, 42224, 42225 },
["description"] = "All of Kel'danath's experiments to connect with the withered failed, and some even made them more dangerous. Until he found Theryn . His arcane essence - the very soul of the shal'dorei - had been touched by something special. But what? By weaving my arcane essence together with Theryn 's, I can create an empathic bond. This communion will bare his soul to us all - or what's left of it. We need only to feed him mana, and lots of it, in order to begin.",
["objectivesText"] = "Feed Theryn 300 Ancient Mana. Progress: Feed Theryn as much as he will take.",
