["series"] = { 40523, 40529, 40531 },
["description"] = "<name>, if there's one thing I despise, it's slander. A rumor is spreading that one of my recent commissions is a fake. We need to quell these rumors as quickly as possible. I need you to visit the customers I recently worked for and examine their gems. If your claim of being a jewelcrafter is true, then you will be able to spot a fake gem from a mile away. Here's the list of my patrons. Return immediately if you find any truth to these rumors.",
