["description"] = "Do you see the Nightborne outside this room? They hold us here, like mice in a cage. It is more convenient for them that we are pinned down while they search the Sanctum for my father's relics. My companions and I can escape to higher ground with some help. Take this crystal. While standing on a mana focusing rune, use it to overcharge a Conjurer. Their summons will turn on them and create an opening. Use it well, and we will meet you atop the stronghold when the way is clear.",
["objectivesText"] = "Overcharge 3 Imperial Conjurers using the Inert Crystal . You must be standing on a Mana Focuser to use the crystal.",
