["description"] = "Greetings. I am called Nomi . I couldn't help but notice that recipe that you just picked up and... well, you'd never guess it, but I'm a bit of a chef myself. Unfortunately, I'm not much of a fighter, and this place is dangerous. You, on the other hand, are clearly an accomplished <class>. Come find me in Dalaran. Maybe we can work together!",
