["description"] = "I've tried adventuring, and it isn't for me. Cooking is my one true passion: the heat of the stove, the sizzle of bacon... nothing beats it. Let me help you, Master <name>. If you can bring me some recipes, I can work on improving them, here in Dalaran. We'll make a great team. What do you say?",
