["description"] = "Although our forces have dutifully held this citadel since your departure, we have been unable to access most of its resources - the Fel Hammer can only be fully activated by those bearing the mark of a Legion lord. Thankfully, your blades carry that very mark. Use them to activate the Fel Hammer - show your forces your limitless power!",
