["description"] = "Master, there is one more thing I wish to speak to you about. Below us lies an open chamber cut off from the rest of the citadel. We thought you might desire it as your personal sanctum - a place where you might gather your thoughts or scry upon your enemies. The sanctum crystal before you will transport you there - Lady S'theno has already descended to help you get acquainted.",
