["description"] = "<name>, we must find a way to reseal the Tomb of Sargeras. I have uncovered information concerning an ancient relic, which might be the key to stopping the Legion. Our search begins on the ancient elven island of Azsuna . Long ago, it was where the Highborne elves of Suramar perfected their mightiest of magics. Now it is a cursed ruin. The Illidari demon hunters have established a camp on the island. As they are the only people we know in the area, that is where we will begin. Ready to take wing?",
