["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "Greetings, stranger. <Mayruna bows to you.> We arrived from Val'Sharah a short time ago with hopes of settling here. Our journey was not easy and we are weary. These owlcats have made a mess of our camp, as you can surely see. Would you be so kind as to assist us with cleaning up? Then perhaps you can help us establish a new moonwell!",
