["description"] = "Now, <name>, do not mistake me- I am a druid. I understand that nature has a balance. Predators must feed, and others will be hunted. I also understand that tampering with such balance has consequences. That is why I have taken upon myself to walk this land and perform some... ah... calculations. Slay only a small number of the wolves you find, and one alpha. That should reduce their number enough to allow the Sablehorn to thrive without disrupting the flow of things here.",
