["description"] = "Toryl told me about those squid creatures that are controlling my brothers. I have never seen anything like them before around Jandvik. The naga must have brought them from wherever they came. I do not want any more of my kin to suffer the fate of being controlled by the naga. Find out where those squids come from and stop them.",
