["storyline"] = { 41541, 41574, 42158, 42185 },
["series"] = { 41541 },
["description"] = "Titanstrike is in the tomb of Warlord Volund somewhere on the isle of Shield's Rest. It's a dank, sloppy mess adrift in a sea of gloom. Sounds lovely, eh? I've been workin' with a vrykul guide named Prustaga. She'll help us break the wards keepin' the tomb sealed. I know what you're thinkin'... vrykul are trouble. But she hasn't taken a swing at me just yet. Huey'll take us down to the shore. Prustaga's probably found the tomb by now!",
["objectivesText"] = "Accompany Grif Wildheart to Shield's Rest Island and track down Titanstrike. Progress: It's a good thing you found my observation relay! It's been missing for at least a thousand years.",
