["description"] = "You have done a great thing for the blue dragons today, <name>, as well as for my own peace of mind. Now, armed with Light's Wrath, I only ask that you fulfill your original goal, and take the fight to the Legion. I believe Alonsus Faol awaits your return. Safe travels, friend.",
