["series"] = { 41849, 41852 },
["description"] = "I got bad news fer ya - we don't have time to wait for reinforcements. They're sacrificin' prisoners now! Every minute we wait here jabberin' is another life on the line! First things first, my friend Sylara is being held captive in the camp just across the road. We need ta free her - she'll be a valuable ally. We've got ta move move move!",
