["description"] = "Never has our order faced such a difficult challenge. To succeed, we must rely on each other's strengths. However, we only have a few defenders to spare for the battle ahead. Broll, Sylendra, Zen'tabra, and Mylune have all volunteered to accompany you into the valley below, but I can only spare one. Which one will you choose to aid you in battle?",
