["description"] = "We have turned the battle, <name>! The Burning Legion is greatly weakened. Only one task remains. Malorne is locked in battle with Archimonde , the demon that slew him ten thousand years ago. Remember, <name>, we are trapped in Malorne 's nightmare. There is no telling what will manifest here, but we MUST do something. May Elune guide us, <name>.",
