["series"] = { 42388, 42389 },
["description"] = "I will not leave my post without Cora . A group of mages have her caged up like a beast, threatening to put her down. They claim she's responsible for the death of one of their own, but I refuse to believe that. Cora is a loyal and obedient companion; she would never attack without my command. I tracked the demon that was truly responsible to this location, but it put up quite a fight before getting away. My injuries prevented me from giving chase, but I am sure that beast has left a bloody trail.",
["objectivesText"] = "Find the beast responsible for the attacks and bring its head to the mages holding Cora captive. Progress: I will not go anywhere until Cora is at my side.",
