["series"] = { 42390, 43335 },
["description"] = "Now it's time to put your skills to the test. Your order seems to be a lot of watching and waiting without a lot of action. Prove me wrong. Show me that I might have something in common with the Unseen Path. If you survive a night in the wild, then I will consider joining your order.",
["objectivesText"] = "Survive a night within Cliff's Edge according to Rexxar 's rules. Progress: You need to eat to survive in the wild. Boar meat makes an excellent meal when cooked over an open flame. It should not be eaten raw, however. There are many berries that grow in this region. Some are edible, while others cause minor sickness when ingested. You can often determine which are safe to eat by their smell. A sweet aroma often indicates the berry is unsafe to eat. The best firewood can be obtained from dying trees. They are easily identified by their fading, purple leaves.",
["rewardGold"] = 309800,
["rewardXP"] = 1415,
