["description"] = "The mighty Ancient, Ashamane, fell in battle against the Burning Legion ten thousand years ago. To honor her sacrifice, a group of devoted druids called the Ashen forged Ashamane's fangs into powerful daggers. Take my signet and present it to their leader, Delandros Shimmermoon . He will know that you have my blessing. Our flight master, Danise Stargazer , can see you to the shrine.",
