["series"] = { 42133, 42657, 42659 },
["description"] = "As I'm sure you've noticed, demons have taken over the vale. Their arrival has forced many of my fellow druids to flee their homes, but I refuse to go down without a fight. Despite all this, I'm happy to provide enchantments for your weapons, but you should know that it is a delicate process that takes time and concentration, something I have little of lately. If you're willing to shelter me from attackers, I will certainly do my best to enchant your weapons.",
["objectivesText"] = "Protect Lyana Stardust while she enchants the azure weaponry. Progress: Enchanting your weapons will require a great deal of power and concentration.",
