["description"] = "Meryl's illness is troubling. I have seen something similar before, but I cannot think of its name... Talk to my friend. I call her Ari . She has lived here in the Hall of the Guardian since it was last in use. If a tome on magical afflictions is to be found here, she would know where to look.",
