["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "Forcing a vision isn't easy by any means. Finding the ingredients for the elixir alone will take a considerable amount of time, time we don't have. Too many are suffering on the front lines as we speak, in need of the salve we were meant to deliver. I suppose if we all work together, we can make this work. Zabra and I will find the items needed for Velen's elixir, if you take the salve to Faronaar and cure the demon hunters . Does that sound fair?",
