["series"] = { 42886, 42887, 42888, 42890 },
["description"] = "The fiendish imps in this region are an incessant pain on our allies defending the camps below. They are the spawn of a wicked imp-mother named Mother Ozram , who has been seen on a hill to the south. Destroy her, and we will end her brood as well.",
