["description"] = "Highlord, news has reached us of a Legion presence at Black Rook Hold. It is rumored that the night elf commander, Kur'talos Ravencrest, amasses an enormous army behind the fortress walls. Take a group of your most powerful allies, Highlord, and investigate these stories. Lord Ravencrest was a formidable general during Azshara's reign, and if the reports are true, then we must know more.",
