["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "I do not doubt Senegos' plan, but I do have some concerns about the Heart's volatility, especially when combined with nightmare energy. Despite its name, Blood of Sargeras is often used as a tempering agent by master craftsmen. I believe it would work for our ritual as well. You should keep an eye out for it during your travels - we'll need a substantial amount to ensure that everything goes smoothly.",
["objectivesText"] = "Obtain 5 Blood of Sargeras . Progress: It can be difficult to extract properly, but I do not wish to leave anything to chance.",
