["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "The Moon Guard were once among the most powerful sorcerers on Azeroth. Most assumed their ranks demolished after the War of the Ancients, but it seems they have managed to survive in their ancient stronghold in Suramar! I believe they could be valuable allies in our quest if they still oppose the Legion. <name>, if you can save what remains of the Guard, I will work to convince the Council of Six to lend us additional aid.",
