["description"] = "Thar be few pirates ye want to cross swords wit' less than th' Red Blade! They be salty dogs, indeed! That being said... they does have a way wit' rum! I'll level wit' ye, <name>... thar be few rums as jolly as that 'o th' Red Blade. Seein' as ye be headin' off in search 'o clues, ye might as well brin' back a few bottles while ye be at it! Brin' me back as many bottles as ye can find, and I'll reward ye handsomely! Pirates honor, <name>!",
