["description"] = "Whatever Amber Kearnen knew, Mathias Shaw didn't want it gettin' out... Aye, this be dirty business indeed, hiring th' Red Blade at such a price... just to hunt down and kill one of their own! Ye best get back to th' Hall 'o Shadows, and let Lord Ravenholdt know what we found here in Citrine Bay. Whatever SI:7 be up to, it be goin' deeper than we first imagined...",
