["description"] = "Though young King Anduin is a noble soul, he may lack the conviction of his father. The Alliance needs a leader who will do what needs to be done. The Legion will strike at the first hint of weakness. Even now, I sense something amiss, <name>. I fear that not all is as it seems. Quickly, use your Spectral Sight. We must know if there are foes among us!",
