["description"] = "Thalyssra managed to get all 3 to agree to the same thing? I am impressed with her skills of negotiation. Alright hero, Liadrin is already marching on Suramar . Join her forces. Tyrande will flank the city defenders and meet you deeper in. The Nightborne will bring up the rear and hold the territory for us. Oculeth and I will move the Kirin Tor forces to Astravar Harbor. With luck, we shall see you on the other side.",
