["description"] = "Greetings, mortal. For many years I have continued my observation of this planet. The halls of Ulduar have been hollow and silent, save for the occasional clattering whisper from the darkness. I grew so very bored of it! Thus, I have taken up this \"pet battling\" you seem so fond of. Truly, an amusing pastime that will sustain my mind for many centuries! I have been amassing my collection, scouring the stars for tiny beings of cosmic power. Come, let us do battle once more!",
