["series"] = { 44743, 44858, 44859, 44860, 44861, 44862 },
["description"] = "I can barely get these civilians to stand in a straight line. They are untrained, undisciplined, and underarmed. Still, they need to be ready for the real battle. Khadgar suggested we try some field training at the ruins of Black Rook Hold in Val'sharah. The risen forces of Lord Ravencrest apparently remember how to fight. Go, hero, and I will send some trainees to support you.",
