["description"] = "The Nightwell is so overloaded that they could not spare anything for this seal. Instead, they are borrowing power from the ley lines. I have traced one of their power sources to Kel'balor. We should head there immediately so I can determine how best to disable this barrier. Yes of course I said \"we.\" Surely you do not expect me to go without my bodyguard, do you? I shall meet you there!",
["objectivesText"] = "Investigate the ley line device at Kel'balor in the Crimson Thicket. Progress: Have you and Valtrois learned anything about the barrier?",
