["description"] = "I have a plan to feed Shal'Aran. Now that I am no longer starving for mana I have had time to study ley lines in new regions. I detected an eddy of mana in the ley lines of Azsuna. I have plenty of magic at my disposal, but we must visit the ley line in person in order to properly redirect the energy to Shal'Aran. Oculeth has graciously offered to teleport us there, but I could use an assistant. Care to join me?",
