["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "It will take more than a damn shipwreck to bring me down. Those overgrown, vomit-reeking, demon felbags have another thing coming if they think that's all it's gonna take to stop me. <Keeshan coughs up seawater, wiping his mouth dry with his sleeve.> Ughh... I may need a little breather though. Here, take this flare gun and use it to call down artillery strikes on the beach. Rain hell on those worthless, half-goat bastards and I'll rendezvous with you back at the base when the mission is complete! See if you've already completed this by typing: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(45034)) Gather info with the Wowhead Client Download Now Help keep the database up to date!",
