["description"] = "And 'ere I thought I'd never see dis ting again! Although, it don't look like it used to. Aw mon, I'm gonna be in big trouble if I show up wit dis in my hand. Do ya tink you could help me fix it? I don't have da plans for it, cause you see, da first night I spent here, da creatures came up and stole all me tings. But whadd'ya say? Help a bruddah out? I tink if you can figure out what it's made from, den you can fix it and I can write down da details on how it's made.",
