["description"] = "We must do whatever we can to break the curse that befalls my ancestors. The Burning Legion have set up camp within the ruins that house our dead, ready to make good on the dreadful pact that was drafted so long ago. Each of my ancestor's is burdened with a pendant that binds them to their demonic overlords. It cannot be removed, but as you have shown, with enough power it can be destroyed. End the curse that plagues my ancestors and set their spirits free!",
