["description"] = "Though I have never heard of this \"Nethersworn\" cult, what this manifesto speaks of can't be good. I do have a theory, however. The writing speaks of \"the place its skin is thinnest.\" I think they might be referring to the place where the veil between Azeroth and the Twisting Nether is weakest - the Tomb of Sargeras. With our forces having established a foothold at the Broken Shore, this would be an opportune time for Raest and his cultist allies to reach the tomb. I would suggest you stop them.",
