["description"] = "The time is nigh, $p. With these new dragons in our army, we are prepared for our assault on the Broken Shore. A large detachment of demons have appeared near one of our camps, and there are far too many of them for any of our allies to overcome. Who better to defeat these demons than those without fear of death? Those with quite the large secret weapon? Take Daumyr . We will meet you there.",
