["description"] = "A construct progenitor? What a creative solution to our problem! We probably could channel Kathra'natir's power without releasing him now, but I want to add another layer of protection before we try, just in case. I will not have anyone accusing me of subterfuge! Meet me on the Broken Shore when you are ready.",
