["description"] = "The Legion has sent one demon after another to try to break into the Kirin Tor vaults in the city, but we don't know what they're after. Looks like they finally made it in. We need to find out what was taken, and quickly, before they get a chance to put whatever it is to use. Probe any survivors for information - I'll use my spectral sight to make sure there aren't still any straggling demons lurking about.",
