["description"] = "I have a missive for you from Kor'vas, as well as instructions for getting you there. I can teleport you to them to begin the fight, but you will need some Nethershards to force your way into the Twisting Nether. When you have enough, speak with me and you can begin.",
["objectivesText"] = "The Highlord's Return is the Mage Tower Tank Challenge, available during Legion Timewalking. The following specs can complete this challenge: Blood Death Knight, Vengeance Demon Hunter, Guardian Druid, Brewmaster Monk, Protection Paladin, and Protection Warrior. Completing the challenge awards a recolor of the Tier 20 Mythic set. Our Mage Tower Tank Challenge Guide provides encounter tips, links to detailed spec-specific guides to beat the encounter, and gearing advice. Defeat Highlord Kruul in the Twisting Nether. Speak with War Councilor Victoria to get there.",
