["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "Sigryn's claim to the throne will be challenged by two rivals - Runeseer Faljar of the Bonespeakers and Jarl Velbrand of the Drekirjar. I would begin in Haustvald with the Runeseer. He was a close ally of Skovald and is a powerful mystic. With the Bonespeakers at his charge, he would prove a staunch opponent if he cannot be made to yield. Go now, and claim your destiny in the name of the Valkyra!",
