["description"] = "An overwhelming attack on Bradensbrook is imminent. Together I believe we can blunt the spear before it is cast. While we are dealing with the commanders, we should put down as many unquiet spirits as we can. With their leaders down and their numbers culled, that should give us time to find Erdris Thorn.",
["objectivesText"] = "Slay risen elves and spirits near Bradensbrook. Progress: I can see you've brought a lot of \"peace\" in your day, <class>.",
