["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "Important work has been done by your order, <class>t. Your champions have succeeded time and again in undermining the Legion's invasion. As we make preparations for our assault on the Tomb of Sargeras, we need to keep the demons off balance. By pressuring them at every turn, we will expose vulnerabilities that can be exploited to our advantage. Send out your order's champions, <name>. Their missions are vital to the success of our campaign... especially as our confrontation with Kil'jaeden draws closer.",
