["description"] = "Oh, hello, you must be the new Grandmaster. < Master Bu squints at you and sniffs.> You young ones have no patience these days, always running off to fight your great battles. No time for stories, even good ones, eh? Why don't you put your fists down for a moment and allow an old man to tell you a tale. Maybe buy an old man a drink while you are at it?",
