["description"] = "It seems a lifetime ago that Grandmaster Hight was walking these grounds. While Ban-Lu has served every previous Grandmaster, he and Hight were the greatest of friends. For many years they traveled the land, connecting with its people and maintaining our fragile peace. I cannot imagine how deeply Ban-Lu must have been affected by his passing. There must be some clues to his whereabouts around here. Look sharply.",
