["description"] = "I fear this attack on Goldrinn is only the beginning, <name>. Whoever is ordering these attacks must be found and defeated. Wasn't Thisalee with you? She never returned... brash child. I assume she is already on the Broken Shore, trying to track down this commander. Please, find her. Do not let her take this on alone.",
