["description"] = "Their commander's name is Katith'rax. He's the one who organized these attacks, and now the one who leads them. Luckily, it doesn't seem as though he's far off. Right off the coast is a small island. Seems as though he hides there, barking orders without getting his hands dirty. I, on the other hand, enjoy getting my hands a little dirty. Don't you?",
