["description"] = "I've scoured the tales and legends for armor that might have Wardenscale components and one Cordana Felsong is a name that caught my attention. Evidently she has a family mantle that has what we need. Kill her and find it on her traitor's corpse. The owl will make sure that you spot it. It is likely chipped from years of hard use so restore it to prime condition and bring it back to me.",
["objectivesText"] = "Find and repair Cordana Felsong's Mantle in the Vault of the Wardens in Mythic difficulty. Progress: Have you gotten Cordana's mantle and restored it yet? Rumor has it she is in the Vault of the Wardens.",
