["description"] = "Greetings, <name>. I am a fashion historian and I have astonishing advancements in tailoring, leatherworking, and blacksmithing that I must share with you. Why? A true legend is only as good as their ability to form an epic silhouette on the battlefield and--let's be honest--this is not where you shine. Speak to me again if you wish to learn.",
["objectivesText"] = "Learn from Eliezer Hammerbeard how to create \"flair and drama\" in your wardrobe. Progress: Let me know when you are ready to begin your education. You sorely need it!",
["rewardGold"] = 0,
["rewardXP"] = 770,
