["description"] = "The shattered ruin below us is all that remains of Eredath . We called it the Jewel of Argus. It was here that my fellows in the triumvirate guided our people to prosperity. That was a long time ago. <Velen lapses into a moment of silence.> Join me on the surface. We will begin our search for the Crown of the Triumvirate.",
