["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "In time, Hatuun and his people will set aside their bitterness and become valuable allies. But their trust must be earned. He says their village is beset by a demon called Aggonar and his cruel kin. We need these fiends out of the way before we can seek out Alleria and the others. The chieftain lent us his horn. Use it to call down his people's vengeance upon the demon lieutenants while I carve a path to Aggonar's lair.",
["objectivesText"] = "Slay Kar'aaz , Xeth'tal , and Magraloth in the Annihilan Pits. Progress: Has the threat been dealt with?",
