["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "It was a good thing we sought two sources of energy. Even with the conduits active, the construct has not stirred. It has likely been inactive a long while. Perhaps as long as Eredath has floated above Argus. What a long, lonely vigil it must have been. <Y'mera is silent for a moment as she peers at the construct.> Go ahead and jostle it a little. That combined with one last burst of magic ought to do the trick.",
["objectivesText"] = "Wake the Gatekeeper.",
