["description"] = "I've been hearin' whispers ever since we got to Argus. They're just like Azeroth's, only... they ain't hers. I'm convinced that Argus has a titan of its own that's reachin' out to us! The broken have a relic stowed away that's darn near holy to 'em. Hatuun says they hear whispers from it... I think it might have some sort o' link to Argus itself! It's just in this chamber. Let's see what we can learn.",
["objectivesText"] = "Activate the Sacred Stone to witness Argus' vision with Magni. Progress: I know, I know, it's a lot to ask, but we need all the help we can get lad!",
["rewardGold"] = 30900,
["rewardXP"] = 770,
["rewardItems"] = { 237812 },
