["description"] = "When I rallied to the Xenedar, I left behind a valuable tool. My lightweave loom . Without it, I'm forced to labor for much longer to make garments of power for our allies. But you are powerful, much more so than I. Perhaps you could do me a favor. Should you happen to be in the Arinor Gardens, could you retrieve my loom and return it to me? I'd be more than willing to share my knowledge of sewing lightweave with you.",
