["description"] = "In the past, I was able to make glorious items from the beasts of this land. But then the Legion came and wiped out all those amazing beasts. Now I'm forced to use their polluted hides to craft armor for my allies. I have, however, found a way to remove their taint. The cloth we use is made from special thread infused with Light energy. I devised an oil which when combined with the cloth purifies the leather and makes it usable. Here, take my oil and see for yourself.",
["objectivesText"] = "Gather Fiendish Leather and Lightweave Cloth and use Enstraa's Tanning Oil to create 12 Purified Fiendish Leather . Progress: I often dream of working with unsullied leather again. But who knows when that will ever be...",
["rewardGold"] = 0,
["rewardXP"] = 0,
