["series"] = {  },
["description"] = "The foothold you established allows us to check in with our field operatives. On our last mission here, we set up a bastion to the northeast. It should be defensible for now, but that could change at any moment. Illidan has gone ahead to assess the situation. I suggest you go there and see if he needs a hand.",
["objectivesText"] = "Speak with Illidan at the Veiled Den. Progress: The camp lies to the northeast. It may appear hidden at first glance, but you can find the Light shining in the darkest places.",
